      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i'll try letting the soil dry out more. i did notice the soil stays damp for a really long time even after a week, almost like it's holding onto the water weirdly. do you think it could be something wrong with the soil itself or maybe the pot? i'm worried something is actually rotting down there.",
