      "content": "yeah i'll definitely look into adding some perlite. it's just annoying bc it feels like i'm doing everything right and the plant is still just... dying? it's almost like there's some hidden reason it won't thrive despite the care. is there anything else i might be missing that isn't just the obvious stuff like light or water?",
